  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At the outdoor Shang clan banquet courtyard, Shang Yan Fei appears in a blood colored flame, leans back in the main seat, and casually waves his hand. Seven colored lights sprinkle down like rain, land on the tables as fine dishes, and fill the yard with fragrance; Fang Yuan recognizes the Gu at once as gourmet food box Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          269
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shang_clan",
          "char_shang_yan_fei",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In that earlier life, when great clans allied against the demonic alliance on Yi Tian Mountain, Shang Yan Fei was one of the heads of the allied forces and used gourmet food box Gu to provide for the armies. With a wave of his sleeve, tens of thousands of soldiers received gourmet food, which raised morale, and the Gu became a symbol of Shang Yan Fei and a common topic of talk. Fang Yuan, then a small boss of the lowest level on a supply caravan sub-branch, personally saw seven colored lights fill the sky when Shang Yan Fei used it, and at the present banquet he notes that he is seeing the Gu years early as a Shang guest.",
        "chapters": [
          269
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "prior-life-memory",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the seventh wave of righteous and demonic fighting, the demonic path cuts the righteous path’s supply lines. Shang clan leader Shang Yan Fei arrives with his forces and uses gourmet food box Gu to provide a feast for the army, foiling that scheme.",
        "chapters": [
          966
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "yi-tian-mountain-war",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later summary of the seventh righteous and demonic fight again says Shang Yan Fei personally arrived with his forces and used gourmet food box Gu to provide a feast for the army, foiling the demonic path’s scheme.",
        "chapters": [
          1001
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feast-counter-retold",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
